# Agent dev workflow (MMFV)

## Do not run

- `npm install`, `npm ci`, `npm uninstall`, or any package add/remove command
- `npm run app`, `nx serve`, `ng serve`, or any dev-server / long-running app start
- Docker compose up for local app testing unless the user explicitly asks

When dependencies change, **tell the user** what to install or remove and let them run it manually.

## Allowed verification

- **Lint:** `nx lint <project>` (e.g. `interfaces`, `frontend-data-access-movies`)
- **Format check:** `npx prettier --check .` (or `--write` only if the user asked to format)
- **Build (when needed):** `nx build frontend`, `nx build mmfv-backend`, or `npx tsc -p apps/mmfv-backend/tsconfig.json --noEmit`
- **Typecheck** via build/tsc — not by serving apps

## Prefer

- Static analysis over runtime checks
- Asking the user to run `npm run app` or manual smoke tests when behavior needs verification in a browser

See also `AGENTS.md` at the repo root.
